{"version":1,"content":"<p>蘋果公司新品發佈節奏持續推進。據悉，此前已經開啓預訂的兩款全新產品將於11月13日正式發售，分別為全新的智能家居顯示設備HomeView以及第四代Apple TV 4K。這兩款產品均於10月中旬開放預購，是蘋果近期智能家居產品佈局的重要組成部分。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585630.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T12:43:18.449517+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T12:31:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T12:37:09.265349+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T12:37:09.265349+00:00","content_hash":"816afa81b628e0ef754e5281d1f7f6634b8d22e3bcc2f477b045903f626723fa","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}